msgid "DomainMOD can't connect to its database, so the installation can't run. Check the database settings in _includes/config.inc.php, then try again."
msgstr "DomainMOD 無法連線至其資料庫，因此無法執行安裝程序。請檢查 _includes/config.inc.php 中的資料庫設定，然後再試一次。"

#: _includes/restore-gate.inc.php:450
msgid "DomainMOD can't connect to its database, so the restore can't run. Check the database settings in _includes/config.inc.php, then try again."
msgstr "DomainMOD 無法連線至其資料庫，因此無法執行還原作業。請檢查 _includes/config.inc.php 中的資料庫設定，然後再試一次。"

#: _includes/restore-gate.inc.php:451
msgid "DomainMOD can't connect to its database, so the upgrade can't run. Check the database settings in _includes/config.inc.php, then try again."
msgstr "DomainMOD 無法連線至其資料庫，因此無法執行升級。請檢查 _includes/config.inc.php 中的資料庫設定，然後再試一次。"

#: _includes/restore-gate.inc.php:457
msgid "DomainMOD can't write to its temp folder or lock its temp/restore.lock file. It keeps working, using a database lock where it needs one, but restores are turned off until the web server can write to both, on a file system that supports file locks."
msgstr "DomainMOD 無法寫入其暫存資料夾，也無法鎖定其 temp/restore.lock 檔案。它仍會繼續運作，並在需要時使用資料庫鎖定，但還原功能將保持停用狀態，直到 Web 伺服器能在支援檔案鎖定的檔案系統上，成功寫入上述兩個位置為止。"

#: _includes/restore-gate.inc.php:517 classes/DomainMOD/RestoreLock.php:53
msgid "A restore is in progress. Please try again in a minute."
msgstr "正在進行還原作業。請一分鐘後再試一次。"

#: _includes/restore-gate.inc.php:518 classes/DomainMOD/RestoreLock.php:54
msgid "DomainMOD is busy. Please try again in a minute."
msgstr "DomainMOD 目前正忙。請一分鐘後再試一次。"

#: _includes/restore-gate.inc.php:524
msgid "DomainMOD can't open its restore lock in the temp folder, so scheduled tasks and changes are paused."
msgstr "DomainMOD 無法在暫存資料夾中開啟其還原鎖定，因此排程任務及變更均已暫停。"

#: _includes/restore-gate.inc.php:558
msgid "Someone else was changing the same records at the same time, so this couldn't finish. Please go back, check what was saved, and try again."
msgstr "由於同時有其他人正在修改相同的記錄，因此此操作無法完成。請返回，檢查已儲存的內容，然後再試一次。"

#: _includes/restore-gate.inc.php:565
msgid "Someone else changed this at the same time, so the refresh couldn't finish. Please try again."
msgstr "此時有其他人同時修改了此內容，因此無法完成重新整理。請稍後重試。"

#: _includes/restore-gate.inc.php:571
msgid "Someone else changed this at the same time, so nothing was saved. Please try again."
msgstr "此時有其他人同時修改了此內容，因此未儲存任何變更。請重新嘗試。"

#: _includes/restore-gate.inc.php:667
msgid "If it stopped part-way, an administrator who's still signed in can finish it from Backup & Restore, or it can be finished on the server with php restore.php --recover."
msgstr "如果還原過程中途中斷，仍處於登入狀態的管理員可透過「備份與復原」功能完成該作業，或者直接在伺服器上執行 php restore.php --recover 來完成。"

