#: classes/DomainMOD/Scheduler.php:1047
msgid "%s task was enabled."
msgid_plural "%s tasks were enabled."
msgstr[0] "已啟用 %s 任務。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/Scheduler.php:1049
msgid "%s task is running and was left enabled, so try again once it finishes."
msgid_plural "%s tasks are running and were left enabled, so try again once they finish."
msgstr[0] "%s 任務正在執行中，且已保持啟用狀態，請待其執行完畢後再試一次。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/Scheduler.php:1051
msgid "%s task was disabled."
msgid_plural "%s tasks were disabled."
msgstr[0] "%s 任務已被停用。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/Scheduler.php:1078
msgid "Disable All"
msgstr "停用所有"

#: classes/DomainMOD/Scheduler.php:1079
msgid "Disable every task? They won't run on their schedule until you enable them again, but Run Now still runs them."
msgstr "停用所有工作項目？在您重新啟用它們之前，它們將不會依照排程執行，但「立即執行」功能仍會執行這些工作項目。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/Scheduler.php:1086
msgid "Enable every task? This includes Refresh Domains, which looks up your domains with registrar APIs, RDAP and WHOIS servers, and DNS resolvers."
msgstr "啟用所有任務？這包括「重新整理網域」功能，該功能會透過註冊商 API、RDAP 和 WHOIS 伺服器，以及 DNS 解析器來查詢您的網域。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/Scheduler.php:1087
msgid "Enable every task? Each one will run on its schedule again."
msgstr "啟用所有任務？每個任務都會再次依照其排程執行。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/Scheduler.php:1088
msgid "Enable All"
msgstr "全數啟用"

#: classes/DomainMOD/Scheduler.php:1107 install/go.php:96
msgid "SSL Queue Processing"
msgstr "SSL 佇列處理"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is the software's name, DomainMOD
#: classes/DomainMOD/Scheduler.php:1109
msgid "Reads the certificates of the sites in the SSL Queue and adds them to %s."
msgstr "讀取 SSL 佇列中各網站的憑證，並將其新增至 %s。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/Scheduler.php:1112
msgid "Emails everyone who's subscribed about upcoming domain, hosting service, and SSL certificate renewals. Users can subscribe in their User Profile, and administrators can set the From address and the number of days the email covers in System Settings."
msgstr "向所有訂閱者發送電子郵件，通知即將到期的網域、主機服務及 SSL 憑證續約事宜。使用者可在「使用者資料」中訂閱此服務，而管理員則可在「系統設定」中設定寄件者地址以及電子郵件涵蓋的天數。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/Scheduler.php:1119
msgid "Converts domains to lowercase, checks that every TLD is correct, and records the status of each domain in your segments, which keeps segment filtering up to date. It also checks the domain, SSL certificate, and fee data against each other, and deletes unused fees. Finally, it removes change history older than the retention period set in System Settings."
msgstr "將網域名稱轉換為小寫、檢查每個頂級網域 (TLD) 是否正確，並記錄各區段中每個網域的狀態，以確保區段篩選功能保持最新。此外，它還會比對網域名稱、SSL 憑證及費用資料，並刪除未使用的費用。最後，它會移除超過「系統設定」中設定之保留期限的變更記錄。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/Scheduler.php:1129
msgid "Refreshes the expiry date, DNS servers, and other details of each live domain, a few domains at a time."
msgstr "每次處理幾個網域，以更新每個有效網域的到期日期、DNS 伺服器及其他詳細資訊。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/Scheduler.php:1132
msgid "Checks the domains on the Watch List with public RDAP and WHOIS servers, a few at a time: weekly while a domain is far from expiry, daily near and after expiry, and more often once deletion is pending."
msgstr "透過公開的 RDAP 和 WHOIS 伺服器，分批檢查「觀察清單」中的網域：當網域距離到期日尚遠時，每週檢查一次；接近到期日及到期後，則每日檢查一次；一旦進入待刪除狀態，檢查頻率將進一步提高。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/Scheduler.php:1148
msgid "Every 10 Minutes"
msgstr "每10分鐘"

#: classes/DomainMOD/Smtp.php:74
msgid "An SMTP username is set, but the protocol isn't TLS or SSL, so nothing was sent. In the System Settings, choose TLS or SSL, or leave the username and password blank."
msgstr "已設定 SMTP 使用者名稱，但協定並非 TLS 或 SSL，因此未傳送任何內容。請在「系統設定」中選擇 TLS 或 SSL，或將使用者名稱和密碼留空。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslQueue.php:147
msgid "Imported, but the certificate isn't trusted."
msgstr "已匯入，但該憑證未被視為可信。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslQueue.php:149
msgid "Imported, but the certificate has expired."
msgstr "已匯入，但憑證已過期。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslQueue.php:151
msgid "The site's certificate doesn't cover this hostname (it's often the hosting company's shared certificate)."
msgstr "該網站的憑證未涵蓋此主機名稱（這通常是主機代管公司的共用憑證）。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslQueue.php:153
msgid "This certificate isn't valid yet. Retry it after its start date."
msgstr "此憑證目前尚不生效。請於其生效日期之後再試一次。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslQueue.php:155
msgid "This hostname doesn't resolve."
msgstr "此主機名稱無法解析。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslQueue.php:157
msgid "This hostname resolves to an address that isn't public, so it can't be checked."
msgstr "此主機名稱解析出的位址並非公開位址，因此無法進行驗證。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslQueue.php:159
msgid "Nothing answered on port 443."
msgstr "443 埠沒有回應。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslQueue.php:161
msgid "The site answered on port 443, but not with TLS."
msgstr "該網站在 443 埠上回應，但未使用 TLS。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslQueue.php:163
msgid "The lookup ran out of time."
msgstr "查詢超時。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslQueue.php:165
msgid "Something chosen when this hostname was queued has changed or been deleted. Delete this queue entry and add the hostname again."
msgstr "在將此主機名稱加入佇列時所選定的某項內容已變更或遭刪除。請刪除此佇列項目，並重新新增該主機名稱。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslQueue.php:167
msgid "DomainMOD couldn't write a temporary file to check this certificate. Check that PHP's temporary folder is writable."
msgstr "DomainMOD 無法寫入臨時檔案以驗證此憑證。請確認 PHP 的臨時資料夾具有寫入權限。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslQueue.php:169
msgid "This hostname is longer than the 100 characters an SSL certificate's Host / Label can hold."
msgstr "此主機名稱長度超過 SSL 憑證的「主機 / 標籤」欄位所能容納的 100 個字元。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslQueue.php:171
msgid "A date in this certificate can't be stored."
msgstr "此憑證中的日期無法儲存。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslQueue.php:173
msgid "The certificate couldn't be saved."
msgstr "無法儲存該憑證。"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is a number, and %2$s is the name of the "Add SSL Certificates" action.
#: classes/DomainMOD/SslQueue.php:534
msgid "SSL certificate lookups are only added for lists of up to %1$s domains. You can add them from %2$s in parts."
msgstr "SSL 憑證查詢功能僅適用於最多 %1$s 個網域的清單。您可以從 %2$s 開始分批新增這些網域。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslQueue.php:559 queue/add/ssl.php:228
msgid "The SSL Queue already has %s hostname waiting. Please wait for some to finish before adding more."
msgid_plural "The SSL Queue already has %s hostnames waiting. Please wait for some to finish before adding more."
msgstr[0] "SSL 佇列中已有 %s 個主機名稱在等待處理。請待部分主機名稱處理完畢後，再新增其他主機名稱。"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is the name of the "Add SSL Certificates" action.
#: classes/DomainMOD/SslQueue.php:574
msgid "The domains were added to the queue, but their SSL certificate lookups couldn't be. You can add them from %s."
msgstr "這些網域已加入佇列，但無法進行 SSL 憑證查詢。您可以從 %s 將它們加入佇列。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslQueue.php:775
msgid "Waiting for the Domain"
msgstr "等待網域"

#. TRANSLATORS: Shown under "Waiting for the Domain" in the SSL Queue. %1$s is a domain, and %2$d is a number of days.
#: classes/DomainMOD/SslQueue.php:777
msgid "Waiting up to %2$d day for %1$s to be added. If the wait ends first, the SSL Queue checks the site anyway and links the certificate only if a matching domain has been added by then."
msgid_plural "Waiting up to %2$d days for %1$s to be added. If the wait ends first, the SSL Queue checks the site anyway and links the certificate only if a matching domain has been added by then."
msgstr[0] "將等待長達 %2$d 天，以待 %1$s 被加入。若等待時間先結束，SSL 佇列仍會檢查該網站，並僅在屆時已新增相符網域的情況下，才會將憑證進行關聯。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslQueue.php:787
msgid "Retrying"
msgstr "重新嘗試"

#. TRANSLATORS: Shown under "Retrying" in the SSL Queue, before the reason. %1$s and %2$s are numbers, such as "Attempt 1 of 3 failed."
#: classes/DomainMOD/SslQueue.php:789
msgid "Attempt %1$s of %2$s failed."
msgstr "第 %1$s 次嘗試（共 %2$s 次）失敗。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslQueue.php:794 queue/index.php:223 queue/index.php:760
msgid "Imported"
msgstr "已匯入"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslQueue.php:795
msgid "Not trusted"
msgstr "不被信任"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslQueue.php:800
msgid "Already in SSL Queue"
msgstr "已位於 SSL 佇列中"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslQueue.php:808
msgid "Failed"
msgstr "失敗"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslRefresh.php:68
msgid "Refresh becomes available after the next database update."
msgstr "下一次資料庫更新後，即可使用「重新整理」功能。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslRefresh.php:81 classes/DomainMOD/SslRefresh.php:97
msgid "SSL certificate %s couldn't be refreshed."
msgstr "無法更新 SSL 憑證 %s。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslRefresh.php:82
msgid "This SSL certificate is already being refreshed. Please try again in a moment."
msgstr "此 SSL 憑證正在更新中。請稍後再試。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslRefresh.php:100
msgid "This SSL certificate was changed in another window. Please reload the page and try again."
msgstr "此 SSL 憑證已在另一個視窗中被變更。請重新載入頁面並再次嘗試。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslRefresh.php:122
msgid "SSL certificate %s refreshed."
msgstr "SSL 憑證 %s 已更新。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslRefresh.php:176
msgid "Refresh needs this certificate's Host / Label to be the hostname it's installed on, such as example.com."
msgstr "「重新整理」需要此憑證的「主機 / 標籤」與其安裝的主機名稱相同，例如 example.com。"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is the SSL certificate's Host / Label, and %2$s is the domain it's linked to.
#: classes/DomainMOD/SslRefresh.php:181
msgid "This certificate's Host / Label, %1$s, isn't part of its domain, %2$s. Link the certificate to the right domain, set its Domain to None, or change its Host / Label. Then refresh the certificate."
msgstr "此憑證的「主機 / 標籤」%1$s 並非其網域 %2$s 的一部分。請將憑證連結至正確的網域、將其「網域」設定為「無」，或變更其「主機 / 標籤」。然後重新載入憑證。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslRefresh.php:217
msgid "Please wait %d second before refreshing this SSL certificate again."
msgid_plural "Please wait %d seconds before refreshing this SSL certificate again."
msgstr[0] "請等待 %d 秒，然後再重新載入此 SSL 憑證。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslRefresh.php:225
msgid "Please wait %d second before refreshing another SSL certificate."
msgid_plural "Please wait %d seconds before refreshing another SSL certificate."
msgstr[0] "請等待 %d 秒，然後再重新載入另一份 SSL 憑證。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslRefresh.php:236
msgid "The lookup had to wait for another connection to the same address. Please try again shortly."
msgstr "此查詢必須等待另一條連線至同一地址。請稍後再試。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslRefresh.php:285
msgid "The SSL certificate changed while it was being refreshed. Please try again."
msgstr "SSL 憑證在更新過程中發生變更。請重新嘗試。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslRefresh.php:368
msgid "The SSL certificate couldn't be updated. Please try again."
msgstr "無法更新 SSL 憑證。請重試。"

#. TRANSLATORS: %1$s is the SSL certificate's status before the refresh, and %2$s is its new status.
#: classes/DomainMOD/SslRefresh.php:411
msgid "Status changed from %1$s to %2$s."
msgstr "狀態已從 %1$s 變更為 %2$s。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslRefresh.php:424
msgid "The certificate no longer names its issuer."
msgstr "該憑證不再註明其簽發者。"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is the name of the company that issued the SSL certificate, such as Let's Encrypt.
#: classes/DomainMOD/SslRefresh.php:433
msgid "The certificate is now issued by %s."
msgstr "該憑證現由 %s 簽發。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslRefresh.php:467
msgid "This certificate has expired."
msgstr "此憑證已過期。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslRefresh.php:470
msgid "This certificate is self-signed."
msgstr "此憑證為自簽名憑證。"

#: classes/DomainMOD/SslRefresh.php:470
msgid "This certificate isn't trusted."
msgstr "此憑證未被視為可信。"

