msgstr "要新增的主機名稱（每行一個，最多 %s 個）"

#: queue/add/ssl.php:281
msgid "Each line can be a hostname, such as example.com, or an https:// address."
msgstr "每行可以是一個主機名稱（例如 example.com），或一個 https:// 格式的網址。"

#: queue/add/ssl.php:286
msgid "Defaults for New Certificates"
msgstr "新憑證的預設值"

