#: settings/two-factor/index.php:666
msgid "Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA) asks for a code from an authenticator app (such as Google Authenticator, Aegis, 1Password, or Bitwarden) after your password, so someone who learns your password still can't sign in."
msgstr "多因素驗證（MFA）會在您輸入密碼後，要求您提供來自驗證器應用程式（例如 Google Authenticator、Aegis、1Password 或 Bitwarden）的驗證碼，因此即使有人得知您的密碼，仍無法登入。"

#: settings/two-factor/index.php:675
msgid "You signed in with a recovery code. If you no longer have your authenticator app, set up a new one now."
msgstr "您已使用恢復碼登入。如果您不再擁有驗證器應用程式，請立即設定一個新的。"

